{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20185","headline":"列仙文 方诸青童君 · 孟郊","name":"列仙文 方诸青童君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大霞霏晨晖，元气无常形。\n玄辔飞霄外，八景乘高清。\n手把玉皇袂，携我晨中生。\n玄庭自嘉会，金书拆华名。\n贤女密所妍，相期洛水軿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20185.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20185","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}